demographic datasets for Central and South America, Africa and Asia to
support development, disaster response and health applications. The
methods used are designed with full open access and operational
application in mind, using transparent, fully documented and
peer-reviewed methods to produce easily updatable maps with
accompanying metadata and measures of uncertainty.

